<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
    Tishina adaptive launcher foreground.

    Brand mark: a damped sine wave on the left that resolves into a flat horizontal line
    on the right — reads as «звук → тишина» (sound dissipating into silence), matching the
    app's value proposition (§ 17 spec, "брендинг").

    Geometry stays inside the Material 3 adaptive-icon safe zone:
        - canvas:   108×108 dp
        - safe box: x ∈ [21, 87],  y ∈ [21, 87]  (66 dp centred)
        - our path: x ∈ [24, 84],  y ∈ [28, 78]  (3 dp margin on every side)

    A single stroke is used (no fills) so the icon also reads cleanly when the launcher
    applies a circular / squircle / square mask. The same drawable is reused as the
    `<monochrome>` source in the adaptive-icon XML — Android 13+ themed icons take the
    alpha channel and re-tint with the system accent, so a single opaque stroke gives a
    predictable silhouette.
-->
<vector xmlns:android="http://schemas.android.com/apk/res/android"
    android:width="108dp"
    android:height="108dp"
    android:viewportWidth="108"
    android:viewportHeight="108">

    <path
        android:fillColor="#00000000"
        android:strokeColor="#0FB5BA"
        android:strokeWidth="5"
        android:strokeLineCap="round"
        android:strokeLineJoin="round"
        android:pathData="M24,54 C28,22 32,22 36,54 C40,76 44,76 48,54 C52,44 56,44 60,54 L84,54" />

</vector>
